<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Tirupur To Bangalore Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I get an instant moving estimate for a Tirupur to Bangalore relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Use the online estimate tool on our website. Enter the pickup and delivery addresses, inventory size, and preferred moving date. The system instantly calculates the base freight, fuel surcharge, packaging, and insurance costs, then displays a detailed quote within seconds, allowing you to plan your budget confidently.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with Tirupur To Bangalore Packers And Movers services?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This protects every item against loss, theft, or damage during the journey. You can also opt for higher coverage limits or add special insurance for high‑value goods such as electronics, artwork, or antiques.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which factors influence the final cost of moving from Tirupur to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The final tariff depends on the total volume (cubic feet), distance, type of vehicle (18‑ft, 22‑ft or 32‑ft container), fuel surcharge, packaging requirements, and any additional services like disassembly, re‑assembly, or insurance upgrades. Seasonal demand and toll charges on NH 44/33 may also affect pricing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Tirupur to Bangalore shipment take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, our dedicated container trucks complete the 850 km journey in 14‑16 hours, including scheduled driver rest stops. Real‑time GPS tracking and proactive check‑post coordination help avoid delays, ensuring your belongings arrive on the promised delivery window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for a Tirupur to Bangalore parcel or household move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid government‑issued ID, GST‑registered invoice (if applicable), e‑Way bill for goods above the taxable limit, and a signed packing list. Our team assists in preparing the e‑Way bill and ensures all paperwork complies with IBA mover code and state transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging protect fragile items during the Tirupur‑Bangalore transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and finally custom‑cut wooden crates for delicate pieces. Each layer absorbs shocks, prevents moisture ingress, and distributes load evenly, safeguarding items such as glassware, electronics, and temple idols.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why should I choose an IBA‑approved mover for my Tirupur to Bangalore relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval guarantees adherence to national mover standards, including verified driver credentials, vehicle fitness, and transparent billing. Combined with ISO 9001:2015 quality management, this ensures reliable service, legal compliance, and hassle‑free reimbursement claims for corporate or government transfers.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
